@startuml UC72A_Scheduler
!theme plain
title UC72A: Lên lịch tác vụ (scheduler)

actor System
participant "Cron Scheduler" as Scheduler
participant "Backend Service" as Service
database "Database" as DB

' ========== Cleanup expired OTP ==========
Scheduler -> Service: Cron: Mỗi giờ\n(cleanup expired OTP)

Service -> DB: Query users\n(passwordResetOTPExpires < now)
DB --> Service: Users with expired OTP

loop Mỗi user
    Service -> DB: Xóa expired OTP\n(passwordResetOTP: null, passwordResetOTPExpires: null)
    DB --> Service: Cleaned
end

' ========== Cleanup expired tokens ==========
Scheduler -> Service: Cron: Mỗi ngày\n(cleanup expired tokens)

Service -> DB: Query expired tokens\n(emailVerificationTokenExpires < now)
DB --> Service: Expired tokens list

loop Mỗi token
    Service -> DB: Xóa expired token
    DB --> Service: Cleaned
end

' ========== Cleanup old logs ==========
Scheduler -> Service: Cron: Mỗi tuần\n(cleanup old logs)

Service -> DB: Query old logs\n(createdAt < now - 90 days)
DB --> Service: Old logs list

Service -> DB: Xóa logs cũ\n(archive hoặc delete)
DB --> Service: Cleaned

' ========== Send scheduled emails ==========
Scheduler -> Service: Cron: Mỗi 5 phút\n(send scheduled emails)

Service -> DB: Query pending emails\n(status: pending, scheduledAt <= now)
DB --> Service: Pending emails list

loop Mỗi email
    Service -> Service: Gửi email
    Service -> DB: Cập nhật email status\n(status: sent, sentAt: now)
    DB --> Service: Updated
end

' ========== Retry failed notifications ==========
Scheduler -> Service: Cron: Mỗi 10 phút\n(retry failed notifications)

Service -> DB: Query failed notifications\n(status: failed, retryCount < maxRetries)
DB --> Service: Failed notifications list

loop Mỗi notification
    Service -> Service: Retry send notification
    Service -> DB: Cập nhật retry count\n(retryCount++, lastRetryAt: now)
    DB --> Service: Updated
end

note right
  Scheduled tasks:
  - Cleanup expired OTP (hourly)
  - Cleanup expired tokens (daily)
  - Cleanup old logs (weekly)
  - Send scheduled emails (every 5 min)
  - Retry failed notifications (every 10 min)
  - Auto update booking status (hourly/daily)
end note
@enduml

